>Sarkanen</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Lewis</surname><given-names>NG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Stereoselective bimolecular phenoxy radical coupling by an auxiliary (dirigent) protein without an active center</article-title><source>Science</source><year>1997</year><volume>275</volume><fpage>362</fpage><lpage>366</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8994027</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Debeaujon</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Nesi</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Perez</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Devic</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Grandjean</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Caboche</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Lepiniec</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Proanthocyanidin-accumulating cells in <italic>Arabidopsis</italic> testa: regulation of differentiation and role in seed development</article-title><source>The Plant Cell</source><year>2003</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>2514</fpage><lpage>2531</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14555692</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Demura</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukuda</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Transcriptional regulation in wood formation</article-title><source>Trends in Plant Science</source><year>2007</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>64</fpage><lpage>70</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17224301</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gang</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kasahar